# Practice on a short landscape phone (keys and touch): Play from the title,
# the selection moved by arrows and a mark placed with Enter, a hint, Undo,
# the camera angle cycled, a mark placed by touching a cell, then paused and
# left. The practice seed is random, so only the flow is checked.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Three Marks
frames 60
save tm-land-title
touch =Play
until 600 =Undo
frames 90
key ArrowUp 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
until 600 =Your move
frames 30
save tm-land-play
key KeyH 1
until 300 Hint: consider
frames 10
save tm-land-hint
touch =Undo
frames 20
frames 10
key KeyC 1
until 300 Camera: Top-down
frames 60
save tm-land-top
key KeyC 1
frames 5
key KeyC 1
frames 60
touch Row 3, column 3
frames 30
touch =Pause
until 300 =Paused
frames 10
save tm-land-paused
touch =Leave match
until 300 Choose a Mode
frames 10
